{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Time to Grind? Rule Like a Dominus.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dominus Automa</i> is a next-gen autogrinder and a fully online adventure designed for ex-hardcore players who still crave epic battles\u2014but can\u2019t commit hours a day. Step into a low-poly, top-down fantasy world where <strong>your hero fights, gathers, crafts, and grows - even while you\u2019re offline.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're into <strong>solo progression, guild raids, PvP arenas, or full party synergy</strong>, <i>Dominus Automa</i> gives you total control through smart systems and automation. Configure your hero\u2019s behavior, set up combat presets, or issue real-time <strong>voice commands</strong> when you're online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline Progression</strong> \u2013 Your hero keeps training, fighting, and gathering while you're away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Holy Trinity System</strong> \u2013 Classic Tank, Healer, DPS roles for deep tactical play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Commands</strong> \u2013 Direct your character hands-free in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Automation</strong> \u2013 Configure how your character behaves in various situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo &amp; Group Play</strong> \u2013 Tackle dungeons alone or join friends and guildmates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP &amp; Raids</strong> \u2013 Climb the ranks or take on massive challenges together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Gathering &amp; Crafting</strong> \u2013 Build your legacy with smart economy mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low-Poly 3D Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 A clean, modern art style inspired by classics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're commuting, working, or just chilling, your hero keeps fighting. Your world keeps moving. <br>Take command. <strong>Become the Dominus.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on our journey to make this dream into reality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Below you can see a bit of a sneak peak into the current state of the project as we're working on both the visual and functional upgrades. Keep in mind that it's all still work heavily in progress, a lot of changes are yet to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're constantly working on visual upgrades and improving the level design - starting with the tutorial zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/fc4b9ab834918f43271970a087acbcf2.poster.avif?t=1763398206\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/fc4b9ab834918f43271970a087acbcf2.webm?t=1763398206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/fc4b9ab834918f43271970a087acbcf2.mp4?t=1763398206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've recently added the functionality of gathering resources, all of the gathering spots are PvP zones so you'll need to fight for the resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/79deef02c6d07e0e6df6beba1ea51eb5.poster.avif?t=1763398206\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/79deef02c6d07e0e6df6beba1ea51eb5.webm?t=1763398206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/79deef02c6d07e0e6df6beba1ea51eb5.mp4?t=1763398206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What goes very well with gathering? Some crafting obviously, you can use the herbs you gathered to create food to temporarily boost your stats for future endevours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/2d6a876f99e688096f47efbb541ba840.poster.avif?t=1763398206\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/2d6a876f99e688096f47efbb541ba840.webm?t=1763398206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/2d6a876f99e688096f47efbb541ba840.mp4?t=1763398206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to always have a preset prepared for the time you encounter hostile players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/8331a74b60de6608d46d9ad22f2aca2c.poster.avif?t=1763398206\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/8331a74b60de6608d46d9ad22f2aca2c.webm?t=1763398206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/8331a74b60de6608d46d9ad22f2aca2c.mp4?t=1763398206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Way more is yet to come, so be sure to wishlist the project to receive all the relevant updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795810?t=1763398206","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795810?t=1763398206","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/31757131e6157f1bd92c015aad7f77318c2e25ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763398206","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/31757131e6157f1bd92c015aad7f77318c2e25ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763398206","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Time to Grind? Rule Like a Dominus.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dominus Automa</i> is a next-gen autogrinder and a fully online adventure designed for ex-hardcore players who still crave epic battles\u2014but can\u2019t commit hours a day. Step into a low-poly, top-down fantasy world where <strong>your hero fights, gathers, crafts, and grows - even while you\u2019re offline.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're into <strong>solo progression, guild raids, PvP arenas, or full party synergy</strong>, <i>Dominus Automa</i> gives you total control through smart systems and automation. Configure your hero\u2019s behavior, set up combat presets, or issue real-time <strong>voice commands</strong> when you're online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline Progression</strong> \u2013 Your hero keeps training, fighting, and gathering while you're away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Holy Trinity System</strong> \u2013 Classic Tank, Healer, DPS roles for deep tactical play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Commands</strong> \u2013 Direct your character hands-free in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Automation</strong> \u2013 Configure how your character behaves in various situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo &amp; Group Play</strong> \u2013 Tackle dungeons alone or join friends and guildmates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP &amp; Raids</strong> \u2013 Climb the ranks or take on massive challenges together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Gathering &amp; Crafting</strong> \u2013 Build your legacy with smart economy mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low-Poly 3D Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 A clean, modern art style inspired by classics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're commuting, working, or just chilling, your hero keeps fighting. Your world keeps moving. <br>Take command. <strong>Become the Dominus.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on our journey to make this dream into reality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Below you can see a bit of a sneak peak into the current state of the project as we're working on both the visual and functional upgrades. Keep in mind that it's all still work heavily in progress, a lot of changes are yet to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're constantly working on visual upgrades and improving the level design - starting with the tutorial zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/fc4b9ab834918f43271970a087acbcf2.poster.avif?t=1763398206\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/fc4b9ab834918f43271970a087acbcf2.webm?t=1763398206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/fc4b9ab834918f43271970a087acbcf2.mp4?t=1763398206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've recently added the functionality of gathering resources, all of the gathering spots are PvP zones so you'll need to fight for the resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/79deef02c6d07e0e6df6beba1ea51eb5.poster.avif?t=1763398206\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/79deef02c6d07e0e6df6beba1ea51eb5.webm?t=1763398206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/79deef02c6d07e0e6df6beba1ea51eb5.mp4?t=1763398206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What goes very well with gathering? Some crafting obviously, you can use the herbs you gathered to create food to temporarily boost your stats for future endevours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/2d6a876f99e688096f47efbb541ba840.poster.avif?t=1763398206\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/2d6a876f99e688096f47efbb541ba840.webm?t=1763398206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/2d6a876f99e688096f47efbb541ba840.mp4?t=1763398206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to always have a preset prepared for the time you encounter hostile players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/8331a74b60de6608d46d9ad22f2aca2c.poster.avif?t=1763398206\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/8331a74b60de6608d46d9ad22f2aca2c.webm?t=1763398206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/8331a74b60de6608d46d9ad22f2aca2c.mp4?t=1763398206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Way more is yet to come, so be sure to wishlist the project to receive all the relevant updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Metashift Labs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/2d66e02e7a558d7e34667ec5278d9736d807fa38/header.jpg?t=1763398206","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3795810/1238627642/64bc2eb007eb0d2706f1bdcca012c7f6a9b1d377/1763379707/